abstract: >-
  Civic Darwinism, Vol. I. A hybrid analytical-satirical
  essay examining urban habitability degradation through
  five civic perspectives — residence, commuting, leisure,
  public space, and education — in a Mediterranean city
  reconstituted as a platform of value extraction.
